---
import Layout from '../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/community/Photo.astro';
import Join from '../components/community/Join.astro';
import {groupUrl} from '../data/community';
---
<Layout title="Our Community — GHL Bangladesh"><section class="page-hero wrap"><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL ROOTS. SHARED AMBITION.</span><h1>Your people.<br/><em>Your possibilities.</em></h1><p>For the people in Bangladesh turning ideas into businesses with HighLevel. Whether you’re just getting started or already building, you’re welcome here.</p><a class="button" href={groupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the community ↗</a></section><div class="wrap page-photo"><Photo name="meetup" alt="Members of the GHL Bangladesh community at the 2026 meetup" eager sizes="90vw"/></div><section class="section wrap split-content"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LOCAL HOME FOR BUILDERS</span><h2>Different journeys.<br/><em>Common ground.</em></h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">Learning gets better when it’s shared.</p><p>GHL Bangladesh brings together agencies, marketers, developers, and entrepreneurs with a shared interest in HighLevel. It’s a place to ask questions, exchange practical experience, and meet people who understand the work.</p><p>Start a conversation in the Facebook group. Bring an idea to a meetup. Share something you’ve learned. Every connection helps make the community more useful for everyone.</p></div></section><section class="benefits wrap"><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="eyebrow">COME CURIOUS</span><h3>Ask real questions.</h3><p>From your first workflow to your next client project, bring the challenges you’re working through.</p></article><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span class="eyebrow">SHARE GENEROUSLY</span><h3>Make room for others.</h3><p>Offer useful experience, welcome new members, and respect different levels of knowledge.</p></article><article><span class="benefit-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="eyebrow">BUILD CONNECTIONS</span><h3>Keep it human.</h3><p>Listen first, connect thoughtfully, and help turn a local network into meaningful relationships.</p></article></section><section class="section wrap faq"><span class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</span><h2 style="margin-top:20px">Before you <em>join.</em></h2><details><summary>Who is the community for?</summary><p>Agency owners, marketers, developers, entrepreneurs, and anyone in Bangladesh interested in building with HighLevel. You don’t need to be an expert to take part.</p></details><details><summary>Where does the community connect?</summary><p>Start in our <a href={groupUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook group</a>. That’s where you can introduce yourself and follow community and event announcements.</p></details><details><summary>How do I hear about the next meetup?</summary><p>Follow the Facebook group for confirmed dates, locations, and registration details. We’ll also update our <a href="/events">events page</a> when details are available.</p></details><details><summary>Can I suggest a topic or share my experience?</summary><p>Yes. Start a conversation in the group or <a href="/contact">contact the organizer</a> with your idea. Practical questions and real experience help guide useful conversations.</p></details></section><Join/></Layout>
